<title>USA: Boston Acoustics moving toward contract.</title>
<headline>Boston Acoustics moving toward contract.</headline>
<dateline>PEABODY, Mass 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boston Acoustics Inc said Friday it has reached a preliminary agreement with a major computer manufacturer to supply speaker systems.</p>
<p>The company said that the parties anticipate a definitive agreement by the end of February.</p>
<p>Boston Acoustics expects this contract to have a material effect on its sales and earnings for its 1998 fiscal year beginning March 30, 1997.</p>
